article: List Torture Test
drafted: 2025-05-20
published: 2025-06-01


  Every list form the parser knows. Use this post to check list rendering.

Compact

   - eggs
   - milk
   - goats

Two Spaces After the Bullet

   -  eggs
   -  milk
   -  goats

Mixed Spacing

   - eggs
   -  milk
   - cheese

Sparse and Hard Wrapped

   -  Eggs, the kind that you had back in those days when you were on the
      farm and everything was perfect and great.

   -  Milk, ideally from some kind of weird bird. Notice how these items
      wrap to align with the start of the text.

Ordered Types

   1. one
   2. two

   a. one
   b. two

   A. one
   B. two

   3. starts at three
   4. four

Other Bullets

   o  Eggs
   o  Milk

   * Eggs
   * Milk

Mixed Prefixes

  Each prefix change starts a new list, so this is four lists:

   -  eggs
   b. milk
   3. cheese
   o  tacos

Styles in Items

   -  **bold** item
   -  item with `code` and a [link](https://example.com)
